{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"flax_bundle","model_identifier":"flax_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## flax_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x 0.5..5.5, y -0.5..3.5, z -17.0..20.0 (size 5.0 x 4.0 x 37.0 u = 14 x 11 x 104 cm).\nFlax bundle: a ~1 m armful of straw-coloured flax stalks tied in the middle, the seed heads with blue flowers trailing behind (+Z). Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.5.\n"},"description":"## flax_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x 0.5..5.5, y -0.5..3.5, z -17.0..20.0 (size 5.0 x 4.0 x 37.0 u = 14 x 11 x 104 cm).\nFlax bundle: a ~1 m armful of straw-coloured flax stalks tied in the middle, the seed heads with blue flowers trailing behind (+Z). Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.5.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stalks","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[1.0,0.0,-16.0],"to":[5.0,3.0,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[34,37,38.0,40.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,34,34.0,37.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[38,37,42.0,40.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,37,34.0,40.0